  (text "── POWER SECTION ──\nUSB-C and Solar panel feed through Schottky diodes (D1, D2)\ninto CN3065 LiPo charger. Battery connects to AP2112K-3.3 LDO." (at 30 130 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5))))
  (text "── MCU SECTION ──\nESP32-S3-MINI-1-N8 with native USB.\nSPI bus connects to SX1262. ADC1 monitors battery." (at 200 130 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5))))
  (text "── LoRa SECTION ──\nSX1262 with 32MHz TCXO.\n868MHz π-network matching to SMA connector." (at 300 130 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5))))
)